{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Headphones strongly recommended!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>They can't see you if you can't see them</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have to find your way out of a fully decorated and furnished haunted mansion, navigating only by sound and the slight glimpses you get through your blindfold. Not all doors are open, so you'll have to find the keys to unlock them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060520/extras/8972a28e127eb42ea12e61d88fbe39db.webp?t=1759170450\" width=780 height=25 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Listen to your footsteps</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sounds of your footsteps are a crucial indicator in telling you if you are moving forward or against a wall. They also provide you information about the surface you are moving on and help you identify different areas in the mansion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060520/extras/8972a28e127eb42ea12e61d88fbe39db.webp?t=1759170450\" width=780 height=25 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Orientate yourself by listening to anomalies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are several noises coming from fixed locations, so you can use them to figure out the direction you want to move towards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060520/extras/8972a28e127eb42ea12e61d88fbe39db.webp?t=1759170450\" width=780 height=25 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don't get stuck on furniture</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since the mansion is in a very orderly state with chairs, tables, cupboards, and other furniture not placed in the middle of the room, there are no corners or crevices you can get stuck in. Still, try not to mistake a small table for a wall or a corner for a dead end.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4060520?t=1759170450","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4060520?t=1759170450","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060520/6c568577c01561370cdebca5e629c5d75e27d191/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759170450","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060520/6c568577c01561370cdebca5e629c5d75e27d191/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759170450","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Headphones strongly recommended!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>They can't see you if you can't see them</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have to find your way out of a fully decorated and furnished haunted mansion, navigating only by sound and the slight glimpses you get through your blindfold. Not all doors are open, so you'll have to find the keys to unlock them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060520/extras/8972a28e127eb42ea12e61d88fbe39db.webp?t=1759170450\" width=780 height=25 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Listen to your footsteps</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sounds of your footsteps are a crucial indicator in telling you if you are moving forward or against a wall. They also provide you information about the surface you are moving on and help you identify different areas in the mansion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060520/extras/8972a28e127eb42ea12e61d88fbe39db.webp?t=1759170450\" width=780 height=25 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Orientate yourself by listening to anomalies</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are several noises coming from fixed locations, so you can use them to figure out the direction you want to move towards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060520/extras/8972a28e127eb42ea12e61d88fbe39db.webp?t=1759170450\" width=780 height=25 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don't get stuck on furniture</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since the mansion is in a very orderly state with chairs, tables, cupboards, and other furniture not placed in the middle of the room, there are no corners or crevices you can get stuck in. Still, try not to mistake a small table for a wall or a corner for a dead end.</p>","developers":["YKey Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060520/3f0e01d040e6e80efdd1131cc9b861d8e0e15b5c/header.jpg?t=1759170450","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Don't Look!","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.5Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GForce GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Headphones are strongly recommended!</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["YKey Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Medo","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"\u00c4ngstigende Inhalte","rating":"6","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"6","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"27 Oct, 2025"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060520/8fe13968b3de2444b1f04c246ac94c54e49b5ac0/ss_8fe13968b3de2444b1f04c246ac94c54e49b5ac0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1759170450","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060520/8fe13968b3de2444b1f04c246ac94c54e49b5ac0/ss_8fe13968b3de2444b1f04c246ac94c54e49b5ac0.600x338.jpg?t=1759170450"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060520/bc69d497973a3a2e5765c79f0220773fc47b4ac4/ss_bc69d497973a3a2e5765c79f0220773fc47b4ac4.1920x1080.jpg?t=1759170450","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060520/bc69d497973a3a2e5765c79f0220773fc47b4ac4/ss_bc69d497973a3a2e5765c79f0220773fc47b4ac4.600x338.jpg?t=1759170450"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060520/509da6eef97971166c3ed37633166d2abd8e4c3c/ss_509da6eef97971166c3ed37633166d2abd8e4c3c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1759170450","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060520/509da6eef97971166c3ed37633166d2abd8e4c3c/ss_509da6eef97971166c3ed37633166d2abd8e4c3c.600x338.jpg?t=1759170450"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060520/1ab02d3c4020c2a42f17facc8facada842c725ce/ss_1ab02d3c4020c2a42f17facc8facada842c725ce.1920x10